        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-853, French Colonial Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe ribbon and reed design is a true classic, based on French Colonial decor. It adds a since of history but not age--a hard thing to do. RK International's Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull is available in a 3 inch as well as a 3-1/2 inch length.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/crossed-indian-drum-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-757\"><b>Matching Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Knob</b></a> and\r\n<a href=\"/products/ornate-edge-cabinet-pull-rosette-rk-international-bp-384\"><b>Matching Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull Rosette</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-853 Ornate Bow Pull with Lines and Crosses:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-853</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-854</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
